numeric.english:
{{speed|1|8|33|12}}
* Using this skill with Expertise of 11 or 12 or above alongside Dwarven Stability allows it to be permanently maintained if your Deldrimor rank is 5 or 4, respectively.
* This skill is most often used for running and can be used with Dodge or similar skills for a non-stop speed boost.

numeric.chinese:
{{速度|1|8|33|12}}
* 如果您的德尔德里莫等级分别为 5 或 4，则在专业知识为 11 或 12 或以上以及矮人稳定性的情况下使用此技能可以永久保持该技能。
* 该技能最常用于奔跑，可以与闪避或类似技能一起使用，以实现不间断的速度提升。

numeric.english:
Similar to Ward of Weakness, this ward spell's recharge time cannot be decreased. For example, activating this ward spell while under the effects of Glyph of Renewal or Glyph of Swiftness will consume the glyph, but the recharge time will not be decreased. However, the recharge time can be increased, e.g., by Glyph of Sacrifice.
{{Outdated info|}}
;February 05, 2019 update; please verify changes to AI behavior.

numeric.chinese:
与虚弱结界类似，该结界法术的充能时间无法减少。例如，在重生雕文或迅捷雕文效果下激活此守卫法术会消耗该雕文，但充能时间不会减少。然而，充能时间可以增加，例如通过牺牲雕文。
{{过时的信息|}}
